orTests.DefectTest.nullAndObjectValuesInMap` with `mvn -pl unirest edu.illinois:nondex-maven-plugin:1.1.2:nondex -Dtest=BehaviorTests.DefectTest#nullAndObjectValuesInMap`\r\n- About [NonDex](https://github.com/TestingResearchIllinois/NonDex).\r\n- Get some failures: \r\n```\r\n[ERROR] Failures:\r\n[ERROR]   DefectTest.nullAndObjectValuesInMap:61 expected: <foo&baz=qux> but was: <baz=qux&foo>\r\n```\r\n 2. Why it fails:\r\n-  In `unirest/src/test/java/BehaviorTests/DefectTest.java` : `Map<String, Object> queryParams = new HashMap<>();` ,\r\n HashMap makes no guarantee about the iteration order.\r\n\r\n3. Fix it:\r\n- By changing `HashMap` to `LinkedHashMap`.", "labels": [], "milestone": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "created_at": "2021-07-19T16:03:24Z", "updated_at": "2021-07-19T17:14:19Z", "closed_at": "2021-07-19T17:14:19Z", "merged_at": "2021-07-19T17:14:19Z", "merge_commit_sha": "c4b7e59a30c36a6493954583fea0cd34f2eb319d", "assignee": null, "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "head": {"label": "LALAYANG:flaky-tests", "ref": "flaky-tests", "repo": {"id": 386861345, "node_id": "MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkzODY4NjEzNDU=", "name": "unirest-java", "full_name": "LALAYANG/unirest-java", "owner": {"login": "LALAYANG", "id": 56383562, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjU2MzgzNTYy", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56383562?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/LALAYANG", "html_url": "https://github.com/LALAYANG", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/LALAYANG/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/LALAYANG/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/LALAYANG/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/LALAYANG/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/LALAYANG/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/LALAYANG/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/LALAYANG/repos", "events_ur